		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Tar-black mindless acidic ooze filled with rot and filth. Dissolves everything.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tentacle +4 (2d6) or 2 spatter (near) +4 (2d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> -3, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Corrosive</strong>. Organic material or metal touching the ooze dissolves on a d6 roll of 1-3.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Immune to fire and lightning.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
